{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-coo11-baby-bath-chair-support-sold-via-amazon-2511-0066","content_id":"1e772e6a-9c83-44f2-9aeb-f458173d8bd2","description":"Product Safety Report for COO11 Baby Bath Chair Support presenting a high risk of drowning.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"f78d9acb-aa81-475d-a7ca-1749ca882348","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-26T18:39:06+00:00","id":"f78d9acb-aa81-475d-a7ca-1749ca882348","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-26T18:39:06+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6927494a345e31ab14ecf5c6/2511-0066-product-safety-report-COO11-baby-bath-chair-support.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: COO11 Baby Bath Chair Support sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of drowning as it does not meet the labelling and warning requirements of the relevant standard.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Baby Baths/Bath Chairs/Bath Cradles</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>COO11</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon Listing Name</td>\n      <td>Coo11 Baby Bath Chair Support, Bathing Safety, Anti-Slip, Comfortable Wash Chair, Lightweight, Portable, TPE Soft Rubber Material, Perfect for Newborn, Suitable for 3+ (Green)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0BLCVCL2C</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Pink and blue baby bath chair support.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_f78d9acb-aa81-475d-a7ca-1749ca882348\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6927494a345e31ab14ecf5c6/2511-0066-product-safety-report-COO11-baby-bath-chair-support.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of drowning as it does not meet the labelling and warning requirements of the relevant standard, BS EN 17022:2018. If a baby is left out of arms reach or without active supervision, they could slip into the water and drown.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product immediately and to contact the distributor for redress.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0066</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-26T18:39:28Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-26","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-26T18:39:28+00:00","links":{"available_